mw2coop patch for maps/_load.gsc (Modern Warfare 2, 64-bit Steam build)

1. Start the co-op campaign framework (it does nothing outside a co-op campaign session).
@@@ replace
	if ( is_coop() )
		maps\_coop::main();
@@@ with
	if ( is_coop() )
		maps\_coop::main();

	maps\_mw2coop::main();
@@@ end

2. A trigger that sends a group of enemies to hunt "the player" sends each to the closest player
   still up (maps\_mw2coop::seek_player; player 1 outside co-op).
@@@ replace
			ai[ i ] SetGoalEntity( level.player );
@@@ with
			ai[ i ] SetGoalEntity( maps\_mw2coop::seek_player( ai[ i ].origin ) );
@@@ end
